---
// Ambient background: slow drifting colour pools behind the top of every page.
// Decorative only, so it ignores the pointer and fades out before the content
// further down. The outer box fills the page and clips, so on a short page the
// glow is cut off instead of stretching the page to fit it.
//
// Sizes follow the screen, with rem floors for small ones: the glow stays solid
// through most of a full-height hero, and the pools grow on wide monitors
// instead of leaving the edges dark.
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="fade-b absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[max(62rem,140svh)]">
    <div class="absolute top-[-14rem] left-0 size-[max(38rem,38vw)] rounded-full bg-accent-800/20 blur-[120px] motion-safe:animate-drift-1"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[-8rem] left-[40%] size-[max(34rem,34vw)] rounded-full bg-accent-950/50 blur-[120px] motion-safe:animate-drift-2"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[max(10rem,30svh)] right-[-10rem] size-[max(30rem,30vw)] rounded-full bg-aurora/15 blur-[120px] motion-safe:animate-drift-3"></div>
    <div class="grid-lines absolute inset-0"></div>
    <div class="grain absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07] mix-blend-overlay"></div>
  </div>
</div>
